 Entry Code: COTALITY2026NOTE | Direct Link: https://dealroadshow.finsight.
 com/e/COTALITY2026NOTE (available now)\n\nDeal context:\nCotality (formerl
 y CoreLogic\, Inc.) is bringing a two-tranche high yield offering consisti
 ng of First Lien Notes (USD Benchmark size\, 5NC2 structure\, rated B2/B-\
 , IPT Mid 8s) and Second Lien Notes ($1.0B\, 5.5NC2 structure\, rated Caa2
 /CCC\, IPT High 11s)\, both distributed as 144A/Reg S for life with an opt
 ional redemption of 10% at 103 for 2 years. The proceeds\, together with a
