  and refinance the entire capital structure including senior secured notes
  due 2028\, the existing 1st Lien Term Loan due 2028\, and the 2nd Lien Te
 rm Loan due 2029. Pricing is expected Thursday 7/16\, with JPM and SPC act
 ing as Joint Global Coordinators and a broad syndicate of 15 joint bookrun
 ners.
